            <div xml:id="d187-a2">

                <pb facs="0305" n="203" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg203"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Imperial edict, October 6, 1908.</hi></head>
                <p>The board of posts and communications memorializes with reference to raising a
                    Government loan for the redemption of the Pei-Han Railway.</p>
                <p>The same board also forwards with approval the memorial of Chang Ming-ch’i
                    advising that an attempt be made to raise a domestic loan for the same
                    purpose.</p>
                <p>Both proposals are sanctioned.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
